### Регистрация пользователя
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/registration/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tester",
  "email": "your.email@example.com",
  "password1": "<YOUR_PASSWORD>",
  "password2": "<YOUR_PASSWORD>"
}

### Логин пользователя (email должен быть подтверждён)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/custom/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your.email@example.com",
  "password": "<YOUR_PASSWORD>"
}

### OAuth через Google — синхронизация пользователя
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/custom/oauth/register-or-login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "123456789",
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "provider": "google"
}

### Сброс пароля
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/password/reset/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your.email@example.com"
}

### Обновление access-токена по refresh
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "<YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN>"
}

### Проверка токена
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/token/verify/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<YOUR_ACCESS_OR_REFRESH_TOKEN>"
}

